stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Invited: Admin Invites User
    
    Invited --> PendingActivation: Invitation Sent
    PendingActivation --> Active: User Accepts<br/>& Completes Setup
    PendingActivation --> Expired: Invitation Expires<br/>(7 days)
    Expired --> Invited: Resend Invitation
    
    Active --> MFARequired: MFA Policy Enabled
    MFARequired --> Active: MFA Configured
    MFARequired --> Suspended: MFA Not Configured<br/>After Grace Period
    
    Active --> Active: Normal Usage<br/>API Calls, Agents, etc.
    
    Active --> PasswordReset: Password Reset Request
    PasswordReset --> Active: New Password Set
    
    Active --> Locked: 5 Failed Login Attempts
    Locked --> Active: Auto-Unlock After 30min<br/>or Admin Unlock
    
    Active --> Suspended: Policy Violation<br/>or Admin Action
    Suspended --> Active: Admin Reactivates
    Suspended --> Deactivated: Prolonged Suspension<br/>(>90 days)
    
    Active --> Deactivated: User Leaves Organization<br/>or Account Closure
    Deactivated --> Archived: Data Retention Period<br/>(30 days)
    Deactivated --> Active: Reactivation Request<br/>(Within 30 days)
    
    Archived --> Deleted: Permanent Deletion<br/>After Retention
    Deleted --> [*]
    
    note right of Active
        Active State Includes:
        - API access enabled
        - Can create/execute agents
        - Can trigger workflows
        - Access to workspace
    end note
    
    note right of Suspended
        Suspended State:
        - Login disabled
        - API keys revoked
        - Resources retained
        - Can be reactivated
    end note
    
    note right of Deactivated
        Deactivated State:
        - All access revoked
        - Data retained
        - 30-day recovery window
    end note
